  "description": "The Process 153 CR is a carbon all mountain bike built for riders seeking enlightenment through steep climbs, technical descents, and very questionable line choices. With 160mm of front travel and 153mm in the rear, it combines efficient pedalling with the grip, support, and composure to charge rough terrain at serious speed. Its lightweight carbon frame delivers sharp, responsive handling without surrendering the legendary toughness the Process family is known for. The result is Nirvana level peace of mind on the way up and Valhalla level confidence when the trail points down. Inner peace is temporary. The next descent is waiting",
